Z||000000||sully5||06-04-2000||06:42 PM||||This past Thursday I took my Fiero on its first road trip. Had a friend of mine come down for my birthday and she wanted to go up to one of the state parks for lunch and hiking. And she wanted to go in the Fiero! We only went about 250 miles, but it felt great, especially considering 2 months ago the car wouldn't stop, ran rougher than guano, and the alternator belt was squalling like a banshee. I was so proud of my little beast. Can't beat a beutiful day of cruizing up in the mountains with the top out, good classic rock and a beutiful woman with ya! It was just about the best birthday I ever had. Sorry to be lengthy, but I just had to let it out. Thanks, Sully||||reg||7
